 through different tools. Users can also save money on EC2 usage through different pricing options.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9b03dd0e3eef0f1aa852f78a09dd171a?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:18:48.169Z"},{"id":"yPmCpExyG","title":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3): A Comprehensive Guide","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/amazon-simple-storage-service-s3-a-comprehensive-guide-82c87fce95f0","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/amazon-simple-storage-service-s3-a-comprehensive-guide-ypmcpexyg","summary":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3) is a highly durable and scalable object storage service provided by Amazon Web Services (AWS). S3 allows users to store, retrieve, and manage data from anywhere on the web. It offers a variety of features, storage classes, and security options.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9b03dd0e3eef0f1aa852f78a09dd171a?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:18:35.440Z"},{"id":"kVCT5aPEk","title":"The key differences between ABAC and RBAC models in AWS","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/the-key-differences-between-abac-and-rbac-models-in-aws-cfb334a82d61","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-key-differences-between-abac-and-rbac-models-in-aws-kvct5apek","summary":"RBAC is a coarse-grained access control model that is often easier to manage and scale, while ABAC is a more fine-grained access control model that is more flexible and precise, but can be more complex to implement and manage.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:18:27.685Z"},{"id":"VsYWxB0nw","title":"Setting Up a CI/CD Pipeline Using AWS and Jenkins: Beginner\u2019s Guide","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/setting-up-a-ci-cd-pipeline-using-aws-and-jenkins-cbfe4fc28c61","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/setting-up-a-ci-cd-pipeline-using-aws-and-jenkins-beginner-s-guide-vsywxb0nw","summary":"Learn how to set up a CI/CD pipeline using AWS and Jenkins with Maven. The pipeline consists of a CI instance, CD instance, and S3 bucket. Jenkins is connected to GitHub via webhooks for triggering builds. Maven is used for building automation. The built package is deployed to an S3 bucket and continuously monitored by the CD instance for deployment to the production environment. The deployment status is displayed using CD EC2 CLI.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/58a9bba6fb75ec5cb5184a5f78973ce2?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":56,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:18:10.323Z"},{"id":"o939yDYob","title":"Amazon EKS with Kubernetes version 1.30 using AWS-CDK","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/amazon-eks-with-kubernetes-version-1-30-using-aws-cdk-99186e58dabb","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/amazon-eks-with-kubernetes-version-1-30-using-aws-cdk-o939ydyob","summary":"Learn how to deploy Amazon EKS with the latest Kubernetes version v1.30 using AWS-CDK. The tutorial provides step-by-step instructions and includes the necessary CDK code and stacks. It also mentions the major changes in Kubernetes version 1.30.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/711f32a8a18d182645a36b7134588d36?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":11,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:17:57.300Z"},{"id":"AYQQDVXjg","title":"What are some key challenges and risks of system testing?","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/what-are-some-key-challenges-and-risks-of-system-testing-2c4ed9d0feee","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-are-some-key-challenges-and-risks-of-system-testing--ayqqdvxjg","summary":"System testing is conducted to ensure that all customer needs and requirements have been met. It helps in identifying bugs, defects, and issues that may arise later on. Challenges of system testing include complexity, integration with Agile and DevOps, lack of communication, missing documentation, and inadequate testing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d476550394f5fee43e09b94c7008aba0?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:17:43.459Z"},{"id":"4ROVc8xQW","title":"Create User Management API \u2014 AWS API Gateway","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/create-user-management-api-aws-api-gateway-b84c1791b4e0","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/create-user-management-api-aws-api-gateway-4rovc8xqw","summary":"Learn how to create a User Management API using AWS API Gateway. This post covers the steps to create and interact with the API, including creating a DynamoDB table, creating AWS Lambda functions, and setting up Amazon API Gateway.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6caf8ebc8db9ab9b1efedc0db7075b06?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":8,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-27T08:13:15.806Z"},{"id":"dYAMIm0Vx","title":"AWS Well-Architected Framework: Mastering the 6 Pillars for Cloud Success","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/aws-well-architected-framework-mastering-the-6-pillars-for-cloud-success-201067cff9ae","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/aws-well-architected-framework-mastering-the-6-pillars-for-cloud-success-dyamim0vx","summary":"The AWS Well-Architected Framework provides a structured approach for building resilient, scalable, and secure cloud architectures. It comprises six pillars - Operational Excellence, Security, Reliability, Performance Efficiency, Cost Optimization, and Well-Architected Review. By following these principles, organizations can optimize resource utilization, enhance performance, and achieve their business goals while minimizing environmental impact.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7dee66f45528484b08edf490b287378a?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-27T08:12:49.121Z"},{"id":"wAvqqtq5E","title":"Mastering AWS CloudWatch: Unveiling Metrics, Logs, Events, and Traces (MELT)","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/mastering-aws-cloudwatch-unveiling-metrics-logs-events-and-traces-melt-72a72463112b","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/mastering-aws-cloudwatch-unveiling-metrics-logs-events-and-traces-melt--wavqqtq5e","summary":"Mastering AWS CloudWatch: Explore the core components of CloudWatch - Metrics, Logs, Events, and Traces (MELT) - and learn how to effectively monitor and manage your AWS resources and applications.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0024383a46b4566e02ecf4a4aebdef83?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-27T08:12:49.075Z"},{"id":"Z3SVJTGeZ","title":"The Silent Revolution: How GenAI is Reshaping Cloud Tech\u2601\ufe0f","url":"https://aws.plainenglish.io/the-silent-revolution-how-genai-is-reshaping-cloud-tech-%EF%B8%8F-30490d4159ba","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-silent-revolution-how-genai-is-reshaping-cloud-tech--z3svjtgez","summary":"GenAI is revolutionizing various industries by generating new content like text, images, and audio using deep learning models. The cloud plays a vital role in supporting and nurturing the growth of GenAI technologies. GenAI can boost innovation and efficiency in the cloud domain by automating content creation, enhancing cloud services, and optimizing operations. AWS provides tools and services like Amazon SageMaker, AWS DeepComposer, AWS DeepRacer, and AWS DeepLens for deploying and integrating Generative AI models.","image":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:1200/1*etDJsZIWf76sb1P_l6ZW3w.gif","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-27T08:12:22.184Z"}],"similar_handles":["microservicesio","planetscale","tia","codrops","angularaddicts"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","tbpn","alexfinn","ryolu_","hamelh